Subject: [A14 2/4] A14 display wake, AUX, HPD, and link lifecycle

Retains wake/teardown corrections, diagnostics and gated alternatives.
The following transparent-LTTPR patch selects the working dock path.

Packaging-only split of the tested stack. Apply all four in series order.
No experiment gates, diagnostics or runtime defaults changed by this split.
